  m_Name: help_colony
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_colony
  displayName: Your colony
  order: 100
  category: Basics
  icon: ants
  body: 'You are the mind of an ant colony. The queen lives in the royal chamber just under the grass, with a handful of workers.


    Workers dig and bring home what they find. Food lets the queen lay eggs, and the eggs hatch into more ants. Ore and other finds pay for buildings and research. The deeper you dig, the harder, stranger and richer the rock gets.


    You don''t steer ants one by one. You give orders (mining orders, storage zones, buildings, scents) and the ants take up the work on their own.


    Nothing ends the game: a starving colony slows down and ants can die, but the colony goes on. When it stops growing, a Nuptial Flight starts a new, stronger one.'
  reveal: 0
  revealBiome: {fileID: 0}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 0}
